  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "eco_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -344
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Ecosystem\n\nA flock grazes on food that regrows. The Simulation node's flocking boids each steer for the nearest ripe food (its `food` pin, weighted by `attract`); a food item a boid reaches is eaten and grows again somewhere around the fertile spot, which drifts. Every meal adds to the population and every boid burns energy, so the population (State, the Population subpatch) rises and starves with the food supply — boom and bust, drawn in the chart (green: ripe food, white: population).\n\n• Hold the mouse: food grows around the cursor instead.\n• Sliders: `hunger` (attract), `speed` (maxSpeed), `regrow` (seconds to ripen), `metabolism` (deaths per boid per second).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Ecosystem\n\nA flock grazes on food that regrows. The Simulation node's flocking boids each steer for the nearest ripe food (its `food` pin, weighted by `attract`); a food item a boid reaches is eaten and grows again somewhere around the fertile spot, which drifts. Every meal adds to the population and every boid burns energy, so the population (State, the Population subpatch) rises and starves with the food supply — boom and bust, drawn in the chart (green: ripe food, white: population).\n\n• Hold the mouse: food grows around the cursor instead.\n• Sliders: `hunger` (attract), `speed` (maxSpeed), `regrow` (seconds to ripen), `metabolism` (deaths per boid per second).",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 280
      }
    },
